  "staff": [
    {
      "id": "58e13219-657e-4e52-9748-ceed97185e0b",
      "first_name": "Takahiro",
      "short_name": "1.TAKA / Owner       (Haircut $130 / Barber haircut $100)      ",
      "long_name": "1.TAKA / Owner       (Haircut $130 / Barber haircut $100)      ",
      "last_name": "Inui",
      "employee_token": "AyDSwvqsidre8ijdZpuB",
      "bio": "\n                                                                                                                                      Born and raised in Tokyo, Taka began his career in some of the city’s most respected salons, where he cultivated a deep understanding of precision cutting and modern aesthetics. In 2011, he brought his talent to New York City, honing his craft in the creative hubs of SoHo and Nolita.\n\nIn 2019, Taka founded Green Room—a boutique salon where craftsmanship meets individuality. Known for his effortless, lifestyle-focused approach to hair, Taka specializes in refined layered cuts and precision men’s grooming. His ability to work seamlessly with all hair types—from straight to wavy—has earned him a loyal following and a reputation for consistently delivering tailored, timeless looks.",
      "profile_image": {
        "url": "https://appointments-production-f.squarecdn.com/files/8fcbd4df0252df54bedb9082eca571c9/original.jpeg"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "55179e49-9b34-4bac-a509-0f9c531c2798",
      "first_name": "Maiko",
      "short_name": "2. MAI / Owner (Haircut $130 / Barber haircut $100)",
      "long_name": "2. MAI / Owner (Haircut $130 / Barber haircut $100)",
      "last_name": "Suzuki",
      "employee_token": "TGOVuKiDGgwG3W6d-pqp",
      "bio": "Wednesday, Thursday, Friday and Sunday -------------\n\nMai is a versatile hairstylist with over 20 years of experience in Tokyo and New York. After honing her skills in the fashion-forward neighborhoods of Harajuku and Odaiba, she moved to New York to continue her creative journey.\n\nIn 2019, Taka and Mai opened their own salon, bringing together their shared passion for beauty and personalized service. Mai specializes in cuts, color, perms, and elegant updos, and has worked on magazine shoots and beauty pageants.\n\nHer goal is simple: to help each guest feel confident and beautiful with a style that truly suits them.",
      "profile_image": {
        "url": "https://appointments-production-f.squarecdn.com/files/3e1ce392aedf905c46245fe8c9b457a6/original.jpeg"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fbo2zhmt7zybya",
      "first_name": "Yukiko",
      "short_name": "3.YUKI / Stylist (Haircut $110 / Barber haircut $80)",
      "long_name": "3.YUKI / Stylist (Haircut $110 / Barber haircut $80)",
      "last_name": "Hirao",
      "employee_token": "TMwi9TMd871v4Ch-",
      "bio": "\n\nYuki Hirao hails from the snowy japanese alps of Nagano, where both her mother and brother were also hair stylists, all three graduates of the same prestigious Tokyo beauty college. She polished her craft for over a decade working salons in the ultra-trendy and upscale Ginza and Daikanyama neighborhoods of Tokyo before moving to America to offer New Yorkers truly authentic japanese salon professionalism. \nYuki enjoys working with all ages, young and old, kids and seniors, even babies!",
      "profile_image": {
        "url": "https://appointments-production-f.squarecdn.com/files/72f49382f18487d9fbda33fbc775d291/original.png"
      }
    }
  ],
